yzes logs. So applicability maybe 3.\n\nI'll output.\n\nNeed format: echo id exactly. For each subscale give \"<subscale>_evidence\" (one sentence) first and then \"<subscale>\" integer.\n\nOrder: originality, paradigm_relatedness, acceptability, implementability, effectiveness, applicability\n\nProvide evidence sentence then score.\n\nLet's produce JSON? Probably lines.\n\nReturn rating of this proposal, echoing its id exactly. For each subscale... give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first and then \"<subscale>\".\n\nWe'll output structured.\n\nProbably:\n\nid: P2276\noriginality_evidence: ...\noriginality: 3\n...\n\nDo that.\n\n",
