ensive or difficult. Evidence: Creating and gaining adoption of an interoperable open-source API/schema across diverse architectures requires substantial research and coordination.\n\nacceptability: 4 = common strategies that violate no norms. Evidence: Publishing open standards for regulatory compliance is socially and legally unobjectionable.\n\nReturn.\n\nEnsure order listed: effectiveness, applicability, paradigm_relatedness, originality, implementability, acceptability.\n\nProvide each with _evidence sentence then score.\n\nLet's produce final answer.",
