rk requires moderate development effort but uses familiar tooling. Score 3.\n\nacceptability evidence: internal testing for regulatory compliance is standard and raises no legal or social concerns. Score 4.\n\napplicability evidence: directly addresses need to meet Article12 logging requirements in R&D workflow. Score 4.\n\neffectiveness evidence: verifying logs early reduces compliance failures but does not itself create the required logging capabilities. Score 3.\n\nReturn JSON? Probably output fields.\n\nNeed format: echo id exactly. For each subscale give <subscale>_evidence then <subscale>.\n\nProbably produce lines.\n\nLet's output:\n\nid: P2990\nparadigm_relatedness_evidence: ...\nparadigm_relatedness: 2\n...\n\nEnsure one sentence evidence.\n\nLet's craft concise sentences.\n\nProceed.",
